  },
  "lesson": {
    "slug": "patient-journey",
    "title": "The Patient's Journey in RT",
    "order": 0,
    "pages": [
      {
        "title": "Understanding the Path",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Purpose: Why This Matters"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This lesson outlines the typical process a patient undergoes when receiving radiation therapy, from the initial consultation through to post-treatment follow-up. Understanding this journey is vital for appreciating the patient's experience and the coordinated efforts of the oncology team."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Task: What You Will Do"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You will learn about each distinct stage in the radiation therapy workflow, including the key activities and team members involved at each step."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Criteria for Success: How You'll Know You've Learned"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "By the end of this lesson, you should be able to: "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "List the main stages of the patient journey in radiation therapy in chronological order."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Describe the primary goal of each stage."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Identify key healthcare professionals involved at different points in the journey."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The patient's journey through radiation therapy is a structured, multi-step process involving a dedicated team of professionals."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stage 1 - The Consultation",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The journey begins with a "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Consultation",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " with a Radiation Oncologist. This is a critical first step."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Key Activities during Consultation:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Patient Evaluation:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Review of medical history, diagnostic tests, and physical examination."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Discussion of Treatment:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " If RT is appropriate, discussion of benefits, risks, side effects, goals, and process."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Questions & Answers:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Patients are encouraged to ask questions."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Consent Process:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Initiation of informed consent."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This meeting establishes the patient-physician relationship."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "knowledge_check",
            "key": "q_page2_1_ans",
            "stem": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Quick Check: What is a primary outcome of the initial consultation?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": [
              "First radiation treatment is given.",
              "Determination of RT appropriateness & plan discussion.",
              "Tumor is surgically removed."
            ],
            "answer": 1,
            "explanation": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stage 2 - Simulation (The Planning Blueprint)",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Next is "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Simulation",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", where the treatment area is precisely defined and mapped."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Key Activities during Simulation:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Patient Positioning:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Carefully positioned on a CT simulator couch in the treatment position."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Immobilization Devices:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Custom or standard devices (masks, molds) created/used for reproducibility."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "CT Scanning:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Images acquired in treatment position for planning."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Marking:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Reference marks (tattoos/ink) placed on skin/device for daily alignment."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Simulation creates the \"blueprint\" for accurate, reproducible treatment."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stage 3 - Dosimetry Planning (Designing the Treatment)",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "After simulation, "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Dosimetry Planning",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " begins, creating an individualized plan."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Key Team Members & Activities:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Medical Dosimetrists & Physicists:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Work with the Radiation Oncologist."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Contouring:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Target volume and critical organs are outlined on simulation images."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Plan Creation:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Software used to determine optimal beam angles, energy, and intensity."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Dose Calculation:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Physicists verify calculations and plan safety."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Plan Review & Approval:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " By Radiation Oncologist and Physicist."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "knowledge_check",
            "key": "q_page4_1_ans",
            "stem": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Quick Check: Who designs the technical plan and calculates dose distributions?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": [
              "RTTs & Nurses",
              "Dosimetrists & Physicists",
              "Radiation Oncologist only"
            ],
            "answer": 1,
            "explanation": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stage 4 - Treatment Delivery (The Daily Process)",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Treatment Delivery",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " is the daily administration of radiation by RTTs."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Key Activities:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Daily Patient Setup:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Precise positioning using marks and immobilization devices."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Image Guidance (IGRT):",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Verifying target position before treatment with on-board imaging."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Operating Linac:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Delivering prescribed dose from the control console."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Patient Monitoring:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Via cameras and audio."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Record Keeping:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Meticulous documentation of each treatment."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Treatments are typically daily (Mon-Fri) for several weeks."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Stage 5 - On-Treatment Monitoring & Management",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text",
            "body": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Patients are regularly monitored throughout their treatment course."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 4
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Key Aspects:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Regular Check-ups:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Weekly (or more frequent) visits with the Oncologist/Nurse."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Side Effect Assessment:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Managing any side effects."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Patient Support:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Addressing questions and providing emotional/educational support."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Plan Adaptation:",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " Possible if significant anatomical changes occur."
